  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 39 * 12 * 6 * 18 * 72 * 8 * 60\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) =, ×, +, +,÷, -\n\n39 * 12 * 6 * 18 * 72 * 8 * 60 ⇒ 39 = 12 × 6 + 18 + 72 ÷ 8 - 60\n\n⇒ 39 = 12 × 6 + 18 + __**72 ÷ 8**__ - 60\n\n⇒ 39 = __**12 × 6**__ + 18 + 9 - 60\n\n⇒ 39 = __**72 + 18 + 9**__ - 60\n\n⇒ 39 = __**99 - 60**__ \n\n⇒ 39 = 39 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 2) ×, -, =, ÷, +, -\n\n39 * 12 * 6 * 18 * 72 * 8 * 60 ⇒ 39 × 12 - 6 = 18 ÷ 72 + 8 - 60\n\n⇒ __**39 × 12**__ - 6 = __**18 ÷ 72**__ + 8 - 60\n\n⇒ __**468 - 6**__ = __**0.25 + 8**__ - 60\n\n⇒ 462 = __**8.25 - 60**__\n\n⇒ 462 ≠ -51.75 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) +, ÷, =, -, ×, +\n\n39 * 12 * 6 * 18 * 72 * 8 * 60 ⇒ 39 + 12 ÷ 6 = 18 - 72 × 8 + 60\n\n⇒ 39 + __**12 ÷ 6**__ = 18 - __**72 **____**×**____** 8**__ + 60\n\n⇒ __**39 + 2**__ = __**18 + 60**__ - 576\n\n⇒ 41 = __**78 - 576**__\n\n⇒ 41 ≠ -498 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4)+, ×, -, =, +, ×\n\n39 * 12 * 6 * 18 * 72 * 8 * 60 ⇒ 39 + 12 × 6 - 18 = 72 + 8 × 60\n\n⇒ 39 + __**12 **____**×**____** 6**__ - 18 = 72 + __**8 **____**× 60**__\n\n⇒ **__39 + 72__** - 18 = __**72 + 480**__\n\n⇒ **__111__****__ - 18__** = 552\n\n⇒ 93 ≠ 552 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
